AI FOMO Index dataset — Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)

The contents of this `data/` directory (the AI FOMO Index dataset: index.json,
seen.json, coverage.json, the markdown files under news/ and the files under
semantic/) are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
License.

You are free to share and adapt the dataset for any purpose, including
commercially, provided you give appropriate credit to "AI FOMO Index" with a link to
the project and indicate if changes were made.

Full license text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

Note: each item links to a third-party source and quotes only its headline.
Headlines, articles and trademarks remain the property of their respective
owners and are not licensed here. This license covers only what AI FOMO Index adds:
the compilation, its structure, tags, scores and other metadata.

The annotations under semantic/ are outputs of a third-party model (Jev, served
by TypeSafe and OpenRouter). They are shared as research records; check the
provider's terms before relying on them beyond this dataset.
